# Quick-match map pool (à la PvPGN's conf/bnmaps.conf). One map per line:
#
#   <queue> <map-filename> [maxslots]
#
# <queue>        : 1v1 or 2v2
# <map-filename> : the official RA2/YR map file name the client loads locally
#                  (quick match doesn't transfer the map, so it must be one the
#                  players already have). A normal `name.map` is used verbatim.
# [maxslots]     : optional; overrides the template's slot count for this map.
#
# The matchbot picks a random map from the matching queue per game; all other
# settings (speed, credits, mode, …) come from the captured/template options.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Enable with:  QM_MAPS_FILE=priv/qm_maps.conf  (copy this file and edit names)
#
# Replace the examples below with the actual official map filenames you want in
# rotation (these names are illustrative):

1v1  MP01T.MAP  2
1v1  MP05T.MAP  2

2v2  MP04T.MAP  4
2v2  MP08T.MAP  4
